    "show_share": true,
    "description": "We are excited to announce and warmly congratulate the Editor-in-Chief,  Stephane Pradines  on the publication of the new  Journal of Material Cultures in the Muslim World (MCMW) , a result of fruitful collaboration between the Aga Khan University's Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations and the  Aga Khan Museum  in Toronto.",
